  "notes": [
    "All 27 unit tables and faction spell/rule descriptions manually transcribed.",
    "Dwarf Champion free Great Heat Hammer; nested combat and pioneer bike rifle replacements.",
    "Land Train two independent optional carriage choices, nested weapon replacements, Tough(6) and Transport values retained on equipment; ForceOrg wound/transport aggregation requires testing.",
    "Powersuit Guard squad-wide disposable Exo-GL price charged once, with model-specific weapons.",
    "Conditional Fortified on combat shields and Fast on Lead Foot, and Infiltrate on Depth Prospector.",
    "One-model specialist and sergeant represented in separate slots; choices requiring original equipment restricted to its branch. New Recruit interactions require testing.",
    "Anti-Cover, Anti-Regen and Armor(2) use existing definitions; Anti-Cover when Shooting phrased as equipment grant from source aura wording.",
    "No other faction or exporter changed."
  ]
